          {
            "id": 2798472,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The test is in four parts. At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet. Now turn to part one. Part one. You will hear a man asking a friend for advice on things to do in the city with a family of visitors.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798473,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The test is in four parts.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 35.47,
                  "from": 33.23,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798480,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 42.67,
                  "from": 36.19,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798501,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now turn to part one.",
