                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798507,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Part one.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 52.475,
                  "from": 51.434998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798510,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You will hear a man asking a friend for advice on things to do in the city with a family of visitors.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 60.199997,
                  "from": 53.594997,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798533,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "First, you have some time to look at questions one to six. Now listen carefully and answer questions one to six.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798534,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "First, you have some time to look at questions one to six.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 64.68,
                  "from": 60.92,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798547,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now listen carefully and answer questions one to six.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 99.205,
                  "from": 94.965004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798557,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Sandra, I seem to remember you had some family visitors staying with you recently.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798558,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Sandra, I seem to remember you had some family visitors staying with you recently.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 108.005,
                  "from": 102.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798573,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Yeah. That's right. My brother and his family were here a couple of months ago.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798574,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Yeah.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 108.485,
                  "from": 108.085,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798576,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That's right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 109.045,
                  "from": 108.485,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798579,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My brother and his family were here a couple of months ago.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.69,
                  "from": 109.57001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798592,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Okay. Good. Well, I wanted to ask your advice. I've got my cousin and her family visiting next month. And as I don't have kids, I've no idea where to take them.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798593,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Okay.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 113.490005,
                  "from": 112.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798595,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Good.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 113.97,
                  "from": 113.490005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798597,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, I wanted to ask your advice.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 116.29,
                  "from": 114.05,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798605,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I've got my cousin and her family visiting next month.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 120.450005,
                  "from": 116.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798616,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And as I don't have kids, I've no idea where to take them.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 124.61,
                  "from": 120.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798630,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Right. What about accommodation? Are they going to stay with you in your flat?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798631,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 125.784996,
                  "from": 124.985,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798633,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "What about accommodation?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 127.225,
                  "from": 125.784996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798637,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Are they going to stay with you in your flat?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 129.625,
                  "from": 127.385,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798648,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "No, thankfully. There wouldn't be room. My cousin wants me to recommend a hotel. Do you know anywhere?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798649,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "No, thankfully.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 130.905,
                  "from": 129.625,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798652,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There wouldn't be room.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 132.10501,
                  "from": 130.905,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798657,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My cousin wants me to recommend a hotel.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.145,
                  "from": 132.425,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798666,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Do you know anywhere?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 136.665,
                  "from": 135.465,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798671,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Yes. I do, actually. I always recommend people stay at the King's Hotel.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798672,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Yes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 137.225,
                  "from": 136.665,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798674,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I do, actually.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 137.94499,
                  "from": 137.225,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798678,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I always recommend people stay at the King's Hotel.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 141.89,
                  "from": 138.53,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798688,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Where's that near?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798689,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Where's that near?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 143.25,
                  "from": 141.97,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798693,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "It's about five minutes walk from Murray Station, so nice and central. It's actually on George Street.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798694,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's about five minutes walk from Murray Station, so nice and central.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 147.65001,
                  "from": 143.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798707,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's actually on George Street.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 149.89,
                  "from": 147.81,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798713,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Oh, yes. I know. I think they're on quite a tight budget. So how much roughly is it to stay there?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798714,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Oh, yes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 150.76999,
                  "from": 149.89,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798717,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 151.17,
                  "from": 150.76999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798720,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I think they're on quite a tight budget.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 154.485,
                  "from": 151.925,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798729,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So how much roughly is it to stay there?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 157.685,
                  "from": 154.72499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798739,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "If you book a family room, it's about a £125 per night. My brother paid for two double rooms in the end, and I think that was around £95 for each room.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798740,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If you book a family room, it's about a £125 per night.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 162.565,
                  "from": 157.765,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798753,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My brother paid for two double rooms in the end, and I think that was around £95 for each room.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 169.59,
                  "from": 163.125,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798774,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Oh, that's not too bad.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798775,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Oh, that's not too bad.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 171.11,
                  "from": 169.59,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798781,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "So how old are your cousins' kids?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798782,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So how old are your cousins' kids?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 173.75,
                  "from": 171.11,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798790,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "12 and nine. So I want to organize some trips while they're here. I was thinking of doing a bus tour of the city centre as none of them have been here before.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798791,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "12 and nine.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 174.87001,
                  "from": 173.75,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798794,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So I want to organize some trips while they're here.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 177.99,
                  "from": 175.11,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798805,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I was thinking of doing a bus tour of the city centre as none of them have been here before.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 184.875,
                  "from": 178.715,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798826,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Those bus tours are quite expensive. I think it's better to do a walking tour. It gives you a much better feel for the city. There's one that starts from Carlton Square. It takes a couple of hours and doesn't cost that much.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798827,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Those bus tours are quite expensive.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 187.355,
                  "from": 185.19499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798834,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I think it's better to do a walking tour.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 190.555,
                  "from": 187.75499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798844,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It gives you a much better feel for the city.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 192.555,
                  "from": 190.555,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798855,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There's one that starts from Carlton Square.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 195.76999,
                  "from": 193.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798863,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It takes a couple of hours and doesn't cost that much.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 198.57,
                  "from": 195.76999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798875,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Sounds good. I'll look that up. Thanks.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798876,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Sounds good.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 199.84999,
                  "from": 198.73,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798879,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'll look that up.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 200.89,
                  "from": 199.84999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798884,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Thanks.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 201.37,
                  "from": 200.89,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798886,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "If the weather's nice, one thing you could do is visit the Old Fort. You could get there by boat. The whole trip takes half a day.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798887,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If the weather's nice, one thing you could do is visit the Old Fort.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 205.12999,
                  "from": 201.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798902,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You could get there by boat.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 207.365,
                  "from": 205.605,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798909,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The whole trip takes half a day.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 209.125,
                  "from": 207.525,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798917,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "That's a really good idea. I'd like to do that myself. And if the weather's bad, I was thinking they could go to the science museum. But maybe they could do that when I'm at work.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798918,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That's a really good idea.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 211.125,
                  "from": 209.125,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798924,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'd like to do that myself.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 212.88501,
                  "from": 211.28499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798931,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And if the weather's bad, I was thinking they could go to the science museum.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 218.08499,
                  "from": 213.36499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798947,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But maybe they could do that when I'm at work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 221.57,
                  "from": 218.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798958,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Yeah. Don't forget it's closed on Mondays.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798959,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Yeah.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 222.04999,
                  "from": 221.65,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2798961,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Don't forget it's closed on Mondays.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 224.53,
                  "from": 222.04999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798968,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "They're here from Saturday for four nights, so Tuesday would be best, I think.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798969,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They're here from Saturday for four nights, so Tuesday would be best, I think.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 230.29,
                  "from": 224.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2798984,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "And it won't be so crowded then. Saturdays are terrible. I took my kids to the exhibition on old computers there, and it was far too crowded. I wanted to go back, but it's finished now.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2798985,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And it won't be so crowded then.",
                "meta": {
