                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799084,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now listen and answer questions seven to 10.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 284.76,
                  "from": 281.32,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2799093,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Have you thought about where to take them to eat?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2799094,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Have you thought about where to take them to eat?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 290.855,
                  "from": 288.215,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2799105,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Well, I really like all the food stalls at Clacton Market. My cousin's vegetarian. I know it's one of the best places for that kind of food.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2799106,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, I really like all the food stalls at Clacton Market.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 295.575,
                  "from": 291.415,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799118,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My cousin's vegetarian.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 297.815,
                  "from": 295.895,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799122,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know it's one of the best places for that kind of food.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 300.935,
                  "from": 297.815,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2799136,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Definitely. And there'll be loads of choice for the kids too. You need to get there quite early, though. But the weekend, most of the stores stop serving lunch at 02:30.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2799137,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Definitely.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 302.06,
                  "from": 301.18,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799139,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And there'll be loads of choice for the kids too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 304.69998,
                  "from": 302.3,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799150,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You need to get there quite early, though.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 307.1,
                  "from": 305.09998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799159,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But the weekend, most of the stores stop serving lunch at 02:30.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 311.09998,
                  "from": 307.18,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2799171,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Good point. It's all going to need careful planning. My cousin said she'd love to take the kids to a show at the theater, but tickets are so expensive.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2799172,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Good point.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 312.06,
                  "from": 311.09998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799175,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's all going to need careful planning.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 314.3,
                  "from": 312.22,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799183,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My cousin said she'd love to take the kids to a show at the theater, but tickets are so expensive.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 321.485,
                  "from": 314.845,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2799204,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I know. But you can get some good deals if you book online with bargaintickets.com for the following day. On some seats, there's a 75% discount.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2799205,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 322.285,
                  "from": 321.485,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799208,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But you can get some good deals if you book online with bargaintickets.com for the following day.",
