              },
              {
                "id": 2799237,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I must try and get some.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 334.75998,
                  "from": 332.68,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2799244,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Yeah. There are lots of things you can do for free as well. No need to spend a fortune.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2799245,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Yeah.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 335.32,
                  "from": 334.75998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799247,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are lots of things you can do for free as well.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 338.12,
                  "from": 335.56,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2799260,
                "level": 2,
